{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56351","headline":"恺悌诗（幷序） 惠风二章（一章十二句，一章八句）（惠风，民被赐也。） 一 · 孙宗闵","name":"恺悌诗（幷序） 惠风二章（一章十二句，一章八句）（惠风，民被赐也。） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"习习惠风，施於千里。\n吹淡民心，洽兹仁理。\n动必响臻，应如草靡。\n泠泠四驰，飘飘中起。\n利物厚生，条纲振纪。\n鼓音埙箎，发馨兰芷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙宗闵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56351.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56351","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}